# asdf/mise-managed tool versions for a reproducible local setup.
#
# Scope: only tools needed to *bootstrap* the project. The Rust toolchain is
# deliberately NOT managed here — rust-toolchain.toml + rustup are the single
# source of truth (channel, components, targets, profile). Adding `rust` here
# would create a second, conflicting toolchain mechanism.
#
# `bun` installs and runs Nx, the orchestrator every gate recipe delegates to
# (scripts/bun.sh resolves this pin; CI's setup-bun reads it). `ruby` runs
# bashcov, the shell coverage tool the root Gemfile.lock pins (CI's setup-ruby
# reads this pin; locally setup checks Ruby is present, as it does Node).
just 1.42.4
bun 1.3.14
ruby 3.3.6
